{"story":{"id":"event-central-70","title":{"zh":"水晶之国","en":"Crystalline Empire"},"category":"stories","kind":"event","image":null,"start":"central.70","chapters":4,"visible":true,"excerpt":{"zh":"一位我们的首席科学官对你们的帝国产生了浓厚的兴趣，虽然很难说你们到底能提供什么我们帝国所没有的。但无论如何，他们希望能宜居你们国家并向你们中最杰出的人学习。","en":"One of our foremost scientists has taken a particular interest in your empire, though it is hard to say what you could offer that we of the Empire could not. In any case, they seek to move to your country and learn from your best."},"tree":{"root":"n0","nodes":{"n0":{"doc":null,"children":["n1"]},"n1":{"doc":"central.70","parent":"n0","via":{"kind":"entry","triggers":[{"zh":"由游戏状态触发","en":"Triggered by game state"}]},"children":["n2","n3"]},"n2":{"doc":"central.71","parent":"n1","via":{"option":"central.70.a","optionIndex":0,"kind":"option","source":"events/central_crystal_events.txt:640"},"children":["n4"]},"n3":{"doc":"central.72","parent":"n1","via":{"option":"central.70.b","optionIndex":1,"kind":"option","source":"events/central_crystal_events.txt:653"},"children":["n5"]},"n4":{"doc":"central.20","parent":"n2","via":{"option":"central.51.a","optionIndex":0,"kind":"option","source":"events/central_crystal_events.txt:680"},"children":[]},"n5":{"ref":"n4","doc":"central.20","parent":"n3","via":{"option":"central.51.a","optionIndex":0,"kind":"option","source":"events/central_crystal_events.txt:710"}}}}},"chapters":[{"id":"central.70","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"水晶之国","en":"Crystalline Empire"},"texts":[{"zh":"一位我们的首席科学官对你们的帝国产生了浓厚的兴趣，虽然很难说你们到底能提供什么我们帝国所没有的。但无论如何，他们希望能宜居你们国家并向你们中最杰出的人学习。","en":"One of our foremost scientists has taken a particular interest in your empire, though it is hard to say what you could offer that we of the Empire could not. In any case, they seek to move to your country and learn from your best."}],"sections":[],"image":null,"hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"central.70.a","label":{"zh":"我们对他们的位置有所打算了。","en":"We have a position in mind for them."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[{"zh":"泽阿亚基科学官将会迁移到[Root.GetName]。","en":"A Zer-Ayaki Scientist will move to [Root.GetName]."}],"conditional":false,"next":[{"target":"central.71","kind":"option","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"option","source":"events/central_crystal_events.txt:640","story":"event-central-70"}],"terminal":false},{"key":"central.70.b","label":{"zh":"这没有他们的位置。","en":"There are no positions available for them."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[{"target":"central.72","kind":"option","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"option","source":"events/central_crystal_events.txt:653","story":"event-central-70"}],"terminal":false}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/central_crystal_events.txt","line":622},"names":{"Root.GetName":{"zh":"我们的帝国","en":"our empire"}}},{"id":"central.71","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"水晶之国","en":"Crystalline Empire"},"texts":[{"zh":"大好消息。希望他们可以对你们的帝国做出比在我们这更大的贡献。\n\n还有什么别的你们想讨论的吗？","en":"Great news. Hopefully they will prove to be more helpful for your empire than they were for ours.\n\nWas there anything else you wanted to discuss?"}],"sections":[],"image":null,"hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"central.51.a","label":{"zh":"是的，我们还有别的事情。","en":"Yes, there was something else we had in mind."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[{"target":"central.20","kind":"option","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"option","source":"events/central_crystal_events.txt:680","story":"event-central-70"}],"terminal":false,"sets":["central_crystal_further_discussions"]},{"key":"central.51.b","label":{"zh":"没，就这样。","en":"No, that is all."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[],"terminal":false}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/central_crystal_events.txt","line":662}},{"id":"central.20","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"水晶之国","en":"Crystalline Empire"},"texts":[{"zh":"你们还有什么想和我们讨论的吗？","en":"What else did you want to discuss with us?"},{"zh":"你现在站在晶态帝国外环舰队指挥官、内陆之守护者的面前。有什么是你想与我们讨论的吗？","en":"You stand in front of the Commander of the Outer Circle Armada of the Crystalline Empire, Protector of the Inner Lands. What is it you wish to discuss with us?"}],"sections":[],"image":null,"hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"SCUM","label":{"zh":"外星渣滓。","en":"Xeno scum."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":true,"next":[],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"identity","key":"civic_fanatic_purifiers","value":true,"label":{"zh":"种族洁癖","en":"Fanatic Purifiers"}}]]},{"key":"TASTY","label":{"zh":"猎物……","en":"Prey..."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":true,"next":[],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"identity","key":"civic_hive_devouring_swarm","value":true,"label":{"zh":"噬杀蜂群","en":"Devouring Swarm"}}]]},{"key":"EXTERMINATE","label":{"zh":"<<侦测到有机生命。通讯终止。>>","en":"<< Organics identified. Communications terminated. >>"},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":true,"next":[],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"identity","key":"civic_machine_terminator","value":true,"label":{"zh":"铁心灭绝者","en":"Determined Exterminator"}}]]},{"key":"central.20.a","label":{"zh":"能不能告诉我更多关于你们家园的事？","en":"Could you tell us more about your homeland?"},"responses":[{"zh":"我们的家园如泡沫幻影，如果我们告诉你太多，将会给它带来末日。你们这些年轻的种族在被允许进入那座圣所之前还有很多需要学习的。\n\n如果你们证明了自己的价值，有朝一日我们会将向你们揭示一切的真理。","en":"Our homeland is like a dream, and if we were to tell you much more about it, that would be the end of it. You younger races still have much to learn before you can be allowed into the sanctum.\n\nOne day, if you prove worthy, we will be able to show you the truth of everything."}],"tooltips":[],"conditional":true,"next":[],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"identity","key":"civic_fanatic_purifiers","value":false,"label":{"zh":"种族洁癖","en":"Fanatic Purifiers"}},{"type":"identity","key":"civic_hive_devouring_swarm","value":false,"label":{"zh":"噬杀蜂群","en":"Devouring Swarm"}},{"type":"identity","key":"civic_machine_terminator","value":false,"label":{"zh":"铁心灭绝者","en":"Determined Exterminator"}},{"type":"flag","scope":"country","name":"central_crystal_first_question","path":"","value":false}]],"sets":["central_crystal_first_question"]},{"key":"central.20.b","label":{"zh":"你们为何降临？","en":"Why have you arrived now?"},"responses":[{"zh":"我们长期以来观察着星系中的其他种族，并且我们在现在的邻居中看到了潜能。当我们收到信息，这些年轻种族中有一个就是我们在等待的那个，我们立刻就准备好了找到他们。\n\n我们还不确定你们这些年轻种族中到底谁是我们正在寻找的，但是我们相信你们都有能力向我们证明自己。希望你们不要辜负我们的期望，而我们可以找到我们都能够接受的条件。","en":"We have long watched over the other races in the galaxy, and we see potential in our current neighbors. When the messenger arrived with news that one of the younger races was the one we had waited for, we immediately prepared to track them down.\n\nWe are not certain which one of you younger races is the one we are looking for, yet, but we believe all of you can prove useful for us. Hopefully you will be able to live up to the expectations we have for you, and we can find terms that both of us will be happy with."}],"tooltips":[],"conditional":true,"next":[],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"identity","key":"civic_fanatic_purifiers","value":false,"label":{"zh":"种族洁癖","en":"Fanatic Purifiers"}},{"type":"identity","key":"civic_hive_devouring_swarm","value":false,"label":{"zh":"噬杀蜂群","en":"Devouring Swarm"}},{"type":"identity","key":"civic_machine_terminator","value":false,"label":{"zh":"铁心灭绝者","en":"Determined Exterminator"}},{"type":"flag","scope":"country","name":"central_crystal_second_question","path":"","value":false}]],"sets":["central_crystal_second_question"]},{"key":"central.20.c","label":{"zh":"有什么你们在找的，或者需要我们帮忙的吗？","en":"Is there anything you are looking for, or need our help with?"},"responses":[{"zh":"没有，时机还没成熟。我们晚些时候再回来，希望那时我们向你能分享更多消息。","en":"No, the time for that is not now. Come back later, and hopefully we will be able to share more news with you."}],"tooltips":[],"conditional":true,"next":[],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"identity","key":"civic_fanatic_purifiers","value":false,"label":{"zh":"种族洁癖","en":"Fanatic Purifiers"}},{"type":"identity","key":"civic_hive_devouring_swarm","value":false,"label":{"zh":"噬杀蜂群","en":"Devouring Swarm"}},{"type":"identity","key":"civic_machine_terminator","value":false,"label":{"zh":"铁心灭绝者","en":"Determined Exterminator"}},{"type":"flag","scope":"country","name":"central_crystal_third_question","path":"","value":false},{"type":"flag","scope":"country","name":"central_crystal_task","path":"","value":true}]],"sets":["central_crystal_third_question"]},{"key":"central.20.c","label":{"zh":"有什么你们在找的，或者需要我们帮忙的吗？","en":"Is there anything you are looking for, or need our help with?"},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":true,"next":[],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"identity","key":"civic_fanatic_purifiers","value":false,"label":{"zh":"种族洁癖","en":"Fanatic Purifiers"}},{"type":"identity","key":"civic_hive_devouring_swarm","value":false,"label":{"zh":"噬杀蜂群","en":"Devouring Swarm"}},{"type":"identity","key":"civic_machine_terminator","value":false,"label":{"zh":"铁心灭绝者","en":"Determined Exterminator"}},{"type":"flag","scope":"country","name":"central_crystal_task","path":"","value":false},{"type":"flag","scope":"country","name":"central_crystal_third_question","path":"","value":false}]],"sets":["central_crystal_third_question"]},{"key":"central.20.d","label":{"zh":"就这样。","en":"That is all."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":true,"next":[],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"identity","key":"civic_fanatic_purifiers","value":false,"label":{"zh":"种族洁癖","en":"Fanatic Purifiers"}},{"type":"identity","key":"civic_hive_devouring_swarm","value":false,"label":{"zh":"噬杀蜂群","en":"Devouring Swarm"}},{"type":"identity","key":"civic_machine_terminator","value":false,"label":{"zh":"铁心灭绝者","en":"Determined Exterminator"}}]]}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/central_crystal_events.txt","line":233},"body":[{"pieces":[{"text":0}],"when":[[{"type":"flag","scope":"country","name":"central_crystal_further_discussions","path":"","value":true}]]},{"pieces":[{"text":1}],"when":[[{"type":"o